      },
      "rationale": "Makes the admission decision for a path the measured change set does not list. It admits the path only when the realization link reports a linking side, as admission attributed_unchanged with a detail naming the linking before/after knowledge and stating that the path is unchanged and not counted as a changed file; otherwise it returns the undetermined or not-listed refusal.",
