      },
      "rationale": "Only reads the inventory it is given: it looks the path up with _entry_for and otherwise returns a SourceAdmission whose entry is None for an attributed unchanged path or a leaf-change-set bound. Opening attributed context therefore never appends an entry to the inventory or alters its listed_total.",
      "role": "enforcement"
